---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Materials
description: "Explore our FDM and resin materials — from PLA and PETG to nylon, TPU, carbon-fibre composites and high-detail resins."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Bondar Labs · Materials</p>
    <h1>Materials</h1>
    <p class="lead">Engineering-grade materials available. We’ll recommend the best option based on strength, heat resistance, flexibility and finish.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for m in collections.materials %}
        <a class="card card-link" href="{{ m.url }}">
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="kicker">{{ m.data.category }}</div>
            <h2 class="h3">{{ m.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="muted">{{ m.data.summary }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/cta-wide.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
